/S /H3
/P 416 0 R
/T (A student who knows that analyze means to examine something carefully and break it into parts can apply that knowledge in science lab reports, history essays, and math problem explanations, the same word doing the same work across every subject.)
/E (A student who knows that analyze means to examine something carefully and break it into parts can apply that knowledge in science lab reports, history essays, and math problem explanations, the same word doing the same work across every subject.)
