<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2057 0 R
/E (Informational meaning-making involves tracking who is involved, what happened, where, and when. It can be challenging when passages contain multiple characters, objects, or events that students must keep track of simultaneously.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
