/E (Our assessments of these skills have been validated against gold standard assessments in phonemic awareness \(CTOPP\), word recognition \(Woodcock-Johnson\), and sentence reading efficiency \(TOSREC\). We are currently running studies to validate the assessment as a dyslexia screener specifically. The linked research shows that our assessment provides similar information to other gold-standard foundational reading skill assessments. )
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [1 1075 0 R 3 1076 0 R 5 1077 0 R 7]
